MY ROLE TITLE: {{ $json.title_with_article }}

MENU OF VERIFIED SIGNALS DETECTED FOR THIS BUSINESS:
{{ $json.signals_menu }}

PROOF POINTS YOU CAN CHOOSE FROM:
{{ $json.proof_options }}

ADJACENT WORKFLOWS SENTENCE TO INCLUDE IN PARAGRAPH 2:
{{ $json.adjacent_steps }}

OFFER / DUAL-PATH CTA TO USE IN PARAGRAPH 3:
{{ $json.cta }}

Decide which signal from the menu is the most powerful angle for this business, select the matching proof point, and write the sequence.

